blog_image_prompt_template:
Product/lifestyle photo for a blog about: {{headline}}

This is for women experiencing {{emotion}} about {{segment}} hair concerns.

Create a 1200x628 landscape image. Focus on product beauty shots, ingredient close-ups, or hair texture details relevant to the topic. The image should make someone want to click and read the article.

email_image_prompt_template:
Email hero image for: {{subject_line}}

Topic: {{headline}} ({{segment}} segment)

Create a 600x400 landscape image. Should create visual curiosity — teaser-oriented, not revealing. Product-forward or abstract/textural. Must be compelling at email width.

